    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where players search for the souls of many lost cats in a 3D world. The protagonist is an angel cat responsible for retrieving the souls of lost cats. Players need to play as the angel cat and explore and discover in different 3D worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The specific content of the game: Control the angel cat to explore, discover and solve light puzzles to find the cat's soul hidden in an unknown area. For example, if the player repairs an array on the map through light puzzles, the cat's soul hidden in the array may be revealed when the array operates. Or the cat's soul may be hidden at the top of an ancient tree, and the player needs to jump to the top to find it. After finding it, as an angel cat, players can teleport it to heaven by touching its soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of cats: There are a total of 200 cats hiding in different worlds. Some are simply concealed in hard-to-detect corners, while others can only be summoned by solving some puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578940/extras/285d88797dda38ab49821eb46deebae6.avif?t=1748834188\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578940/extras/716d97138b5249f55af026ca8e680cf8.avif?t=1748834188\" width=616 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578940/extras/f9de5ab885904eed5ce5af6bd6669e2e.avif?t=1748834188\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where players search for the souls of many lost cats in a 3D world. The protagonist is an angel cat responsible for retrieving the souls of lost cats. Players need to play as the angel cat and explore and discover in different 3D worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The specific content of the game: Control the angel cat to explore, discover and solve light puzzles to find the cat's soul hidden in an unknown area. For example, if the player repairs an array on the map through light puzzles, the cat's soul hidden in the array may be revealed when the array operates. Or the cat's soul may be hidden at the top of an ancient tree, and the player needs to jump to the top to find it. After finding it, as an angel cat, players can teleport it to heaven by touching its soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of cats: There are a total of 200 cats hiding in different worlds. Some are simply concealed in hard-to-detect corners, while others can only be summoned by solving some puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578940/extras/285d88797dda38ab49821eb46deebae6.avif?t=1748834188\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578940/extras/716d97138b5249f55af026ca8e680cf8.avif?t=1748834188\" width=616 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578940/extras/f9de5ab885904eed5ce5af6bd6669e2e.avif?t=1748834188\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p>",
